OL,3,APalestinian parents fear for children's
OL,4,Alives at school as settler attacks grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the first day of the new Palestinian
OL,7,Fschool year, the head-teacher of
OL,8,Fal-Mughayyir boys school arrived at
OL,9,Fwork before dawn, walking past the
OL,10,Ffreshly installed barbed wire fencing
OL,11,Fand reinforced school gates as the sun
OL,12,Fbegan creeping through olive trees
OL,13,Faround the village, deep inside the
OL,14,Foccupied West Bank.
OL,16,F"We are scared," Bassam al-Assaf told
OL,17,Fme. "The students are afraid, and their
OL,18,Fparents are afraid."
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
